# v1.28.0 — line-ending discipline for git.
# git on Windows rewrote DEPLOY.bat to LF-only (observed 19-08-2026), which
# can break batch execution. Batch files are ALWAYS CRLF; everything else
# normalises to LF.
* text=auto
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text
# v1.71.0 - vCard is a CRLF format (RFC 6350). Without this line `* text=auto`
# above rewrites public/cards/*.vcf to LF on the Linux build container, after
# tests/business-cards.mjs has already approved them on Windows.
*.vcf text eol=crlf
*.xlsm binary
